              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Breezy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A really good go-to Waldorf Salad. I substituted the mayo with plain yogurt, decreased the whip cream. Also replaced the sugar with Splenda &amp; Honey. Definitely refrigerate 2 hours prior to serving. The cinnamon was a hit.",
